 .../media/platform/microchip/microchip-sama5d2-isc.c   | 18 +++++++++---------
 .../media/platform/microchip/microchip-sama7g5-isc.c   | 18 +++++++++---------
 3 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

